OL,3,AYoung people should have legal
OL,4,Aguarantee of job or training, Milburn
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FYoung people should have a legal
OL,8,Fguarantee of a job, training or
OL,9,Femployment support, the author of a
OL,10,Fmajor review of youth unemployment has
OL,11,Ftold the BBC.
OL,13,FAlan Milburn, the former Labour
OL,14,Fminister whose proposals on welfare and
OL,15,Fyoung people will be unveiled on
OL,16,FTuesday, said those who refuse to take
OL,17,Fup the help could lose their benefits.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
