OL,3,AUS has floated Ukraine ceding Donbas
OL,4,Afor Nato membership, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS negotiators have touted the idea of
OL,7,FUkraine withdrawing its remaining
OL,8,Fforces from the eastern Donbas region
OL,9,Fin exchange for Nato membership,
OL,10,FVolodymyr Zelensky has said.
OL,12,FThe Ukrainian president's comments on
OL,13,FSaturday come after US envoys visited
OL,14,FMoscow and an EU summit in Dublin as
OL,15,Fpart of ongoing efforts to end the war
OL,16,Fbetween Russia and Ukraine.
OL,18,FKyiv has long sought membership of the
OL,19,Fmilitary alliance as a condition of any
OL,20,Fpeace deal to deter future threats,
OL,21,Fwhile Russia has said another Nato
OL,22,Fmember on its border was unacceptable.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
